Purpose
-------
The software mirrors a Mac display to Panasonic PT-F300-family network projectors so
that hardware the owner already possesses can continue to be used after the vendor's
display software (Wireless Manager ME 6.4) was discontinued and ceased to run on
current versions of macOS. The projectors' network display protocol was reverse
engineered solely to achieve this interoperability.

